Ziwi
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 27 ROTATE 1 2 U
OGU 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OGU 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OGU 7 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OGU 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OGU 7 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OGU 7 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OGU 1 FACE_ALL

UTEX 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UTEX 6 FACE_LAST
UTEX 0 FACE_LAST

COLUMN 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE {DRAW, UTEX, COLUMN, OGU} COLUMN
SRC Rank K
MOVE COLUMN OGU
OR
